msgstr "%(asset)s — cession"

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_assets/models/expodo_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"%(assets)s cannot be deleted: %(count)d depreciation entries have already "
"been posted, and deleting the asset would leave them in the ledger with "
"nothing to justify them. Dispose of the asset instead — the ledger then "
"keeps a trace of what happened."
msgstr ""
"%(assets)s ne peut pas être supprimé : %(count)d écritures de dotation sont "
"déjà comptabilisées, et supprimer le bien les laisserait au grand livre sans"
" rien pour les justifier. Cédez plutôt l'immobilisation — le grand livre "
"garde alors la trace de ce qui s'est passé."

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_assets/models/expodo_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"%(count)d asset account(s) do not match:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"
msgstr ""
"%(count)d compte(s) d'immobilisation ne concordent pas :\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_assets/models/expodo_asset_line.py:0
msgid ""
"%(count)d instalments posted, from %(first)s to %(last)s, totalling "
"%(total)s."
msgstr ""
"%(count)d échéances comptabilisées, du %(first)s au %(last)s, pour un total "
"de %(total)s."

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:expodo_account_assets.constraint_expodo_asset_line_amount_positive
msgid "A depreciation instalment must be strictly positive."
msgstr "Une dotation doit être strictement positive."

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/expodo_account_assets/models/expodo_asset_line.py:0
msgid ""
"A posted instalment cannot be deleted. Reverse its journal entry instead, so"
" the ledger keeps a trace."
msgstr ""
"Une échéance comptabilisée ne peut pas être supprimée. Contrepassez son "
"écriture, pour que le grand livre en garde la trace."

#. module: expodo_account_assets
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:expodo_account_assets.field_expodo_asset_disposal__account_loss_id
msgid ""
"Account charged with the remaining net book value. An expense account, "
"distinct from the ongoing depreciation charge (675 in the French chart)."
msgstr ""
"Compte imputé de la valeur nette comptable restante. Un compte de charge, "
"distinct de la dotation courante (675 dans le plan français)."

